//   currentConstrainedOut := [] which satisfies IsValidPrefix([]) by precondition.
//   For other non-EOS tokens, insideConstrainedOut remains false so the implication is vacuous.
//   Between Phase 1 and Phase 2: OpenConstrainedSpan sets currentConstrainedOut := [] (valid prefix).
//   Phase 3 (constrained loop):
//   - CloseSpanIfComplete: when closed, insideConstrainedOut=false (vacuous); when no-op, state unchanged.
//   - SafeTemperatureConstrainedStep + AppendConstrainedToken: AppendConstrainedToken only appends
//     tokens that are parser-valid next tokens (by the postcondition of SafeTemperatureConstrainedStep),
//     so currentConstrainedOut + [next] is a valid prefix. This preserves the invariant.
//   - EOS path: insideConstrainedOut remains true but we break. After the loop, CloseSpanWithinBudget's
//     postcondition guarantees the invariant.
//   Phase 4 (CloseSpanWithinBudget): postcondition directly guarantees the invariant.
//
// progress: |generated| <= |generatedPrefix| + steps
//   Phase 1: Each iteration increments steps by 1 and appends at most 1 token (non-EOS non-"<<" tokens
