//   |generated| <= |generatedPrefix| + steps.
//   OpenConstrainedSpan: appends "<<" (1 token) and costs 1 step. |generated| increases by 1,
//   steps increases by 1. Invariant preserved.
//   Phase 3: CloseSpanIfComplete costs 1 step and appends at most 1 token (the ">>" delimiter).
//   SafeTemperatureConstrainedStep + AppendConstrainedToken: SafeTemperatureConstrainedStep costs 1 step,
//   AppendConstrainedToken appends 1 token to generated (cost 0). Total: 1 token appended, 1 step used.
//   But we increment steps by 2 in one loop iteration (1 for CloseSpanIfComplete + 1 for temperature step).
//   Generated grows by at most 2 tokens per iteration (">>" + span token). Invariant preserved.
//   Phase 4 (CloseSpanWithinBudget): budget = maxSteps - steps, so |generated| <= |generated_before| + (maxSteps - steps),
